  "text": "• Add and subtract: line up the decimal points (write zeros to fill): 3.5 + 1.25 = 3.50 + 1.25 = 4.75.\n• Multiply: multiply as whole numbers, then count the decimal places in both numbers together: 0.3 × 0.4 → 3 × 4 = 12, two places → 0.12.\n• Divide by a decimal: make the divisor a whole number by multiplying both numbers by 10, 100 …: 2.4 ÷ 0.4 = 24 ÷ 4 = 6.",
  "checks": []
 },
